   <p><date when="1861-03-11">11</date>
<lb/> <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">He</persName> appointed <persName ref="cwgk:N00014344">O. Somes</persName> Notary Public for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000909">M<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">c</hi></hi>Cracken Count</placeName>y and <persName ref="cwgk:N00002583">M. Murphy</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001005">Jefferson County</placeName> until the end of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000923">General Assembly</orgName></p>
<p>He appointed <persName ref="cwgk:N00004956">J Stoddard Byers</persName> Aid with the Rank of Colonel.</p>
<p>He caused to be filed the Oath of <persName ref="cwgk:N00002508">Tho. D. Rand</persName> Com<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> of Deeds for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001006">Pennsylvania.</placeName></p>
  </body>
